  "batch": "<div role=\"alertdialog\" aria-label=\"Approve rename_real_file × 8?\" class=\"space-y-2.5 rounded-xl border border-tone-warn/30 bg-tone-warn/[0.06] p-3\" data-testid=\"chat-approval-card\" data-count=\"8\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-question-mark shrink-0 text-tone-warn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.82 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-100\">The assistant wants to run <code class=\"rounded bg-ink-900/80 px-1 font-mono text-[12px]\" title=\"The exact tool that will run\">rename_real_file</code> <span data-testid=\"approval-count\">× 8</span>. One answer covers all of them.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"break-all font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400\">source: 1.pdf</p><p class=\"break-all font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400\">source: 2.pdf</p><p class=\"break-all font-mono text-[11px] text-zinc-400\">source: 3.pdf</p><p class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-500\">…and 5 more like these</p></div><p data-testid=\"approval-waiting\" class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-tone-warn\">Waiting for you. Nothing runs until you answer.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">“Allow these 8” runs exactly these calls; “this run” stops asking for rename_real_file here; Deny refuses all 8 and the assistant is told you declined.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" data-dock-primary=\"\" class=\"btn-accent text-xs\">Allow these 8</button><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"approval-scope\" data-scope=\"