  "browser_always_docked": "<div role=\"alertdialog\" aria-label=\"Approve browser_click?\" class=\"space-y-2.5 px-4 pb-4 pt-3\" data-testid=\"chat-approval-card\" data-count=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-question-mark shrink-0 text-tone-warn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.82 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-100\">The assistant wants to act in a browser tab <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">(<code class=\"rounded bg-ink-900/80 px-1 font-mono text-[12px]\" title=\"The exact tool that will run\">browser_click</code>)</span>. Your call.</p></div><div data-testid=\"approval-preview\" data-preview=\"args\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div id=\"_r_3_\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-[11px] text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"text-zinc-500\">target:</span> role: button, name: Continue</p></div></div><p data-testid=\"approval-undo\" data-reversible=\"false\" class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">This may not be undoable.</p><p data-testid=\"approval-waiting\" class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-tone-warn\">Waiting for you.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">The turn is paused until you answer. “Once” runs only this call; “this chat” stops asking for browser_click here; Deny refuses it and the assistant is told you declined.</p><p data-testid=\"approval-tab-note\" class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">“Allow for this tab” covers every page action in that browser tab until you close it. Payments, passwords and deletions still ask.</p><p data-testid=\"approval-always-note\" class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">“Always allow exactly this” runs it now and keeps allowing browser_click with exactly these arguments here for 30 days. Different arguments still ask. Revoke it any time on the Autonomy page.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"approval-tab\" class=\"btn-accent text-xs\">Allow for this tab</button><button type=\"button\" data-dock-primary=\"\" class=\"btn-accent text-xs\">Allow once</button><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"approval-scope\" data-scope=\"chat\" class=\"btn-ghost text-xs\">Allow for this chat</button><button type=\"button\" data-testid=\"approval-always\" title=\"Allow browser_click with exactly these arguments here for 30 days\" class=\"btn-ghost text-xs\">Always allow exactly this</button><button type=\"button\" data-dock-decline=\"\" class=\"btn-ghost text-xs text-tone-danger\">Deny</button></div></div>",
  "once_git": "<div role=\"alertdialog\" aria-label=\"Approve shell?\" class=\"space-y-2.5 px-4 pb-4 pt-3\" data-testid=\"chat-approval-card\" data-count=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-question-mark shrink-0 text-tone-warn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.82 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-100\">The assistant wants to run a command <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">(<code class=\"rounded bg-ink-900/80 px-1 font-mono text-[12px]\" title=\"The exact tool that will run\">shell</code>)</span>. Your call.</p></div><div data-testid=\"approval-preview\" data-preview=\"command\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div id=\"_r_4_\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><pre data-testid=\"approval-command\" class=\"max-h-60 overflow-y-auto whitespace-pre-wrap break-all font-mono text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-200\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"select-none text-zinc-500\">$ </span>git push</pre></div></div><p data-testid=\"approval-waiting\" class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-tone-warn\">Waiting for you.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">The turn is paused until you answer. “Allow once” runs only this call; Deny refuses it and the assistant is told you declined.</p><p data-testid=\"approval-git-once\" class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">On this session's own branch, a commit, a push, a change on GitHub, a git setting or git that throws work away asks you every time.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" data-dock-primary=\"\" class=\"btn-accent text-xs\">Allow once</button><button type=\"button\" data-dock-decline=\"\" class=\"btn-ghost text-xs text-tone-danger\">Deny</button></div></div>",
  "once_local": "<div role=\"alertdialog\" aria-label=\"Approve web_fetch?\" class=\"space-y-2.5 rounded-xl border border-tone-warn/30 bg-tone-warn/[0.06] p-3\" data-testid=\"chat-approval-card\" data-count=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-question-mark shrink-0 text-tone-warn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.82 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-100\">The assistant wants to read a web page <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">(<code class=\"rounded bg-ink-900/80 px-1 font-mono text-[12px]\" title=\"The exact tool that will run\">web_fetch</code>)</span>. Your call.</p></div><div data-testid=\"approval-preview\" data-preview=\"args\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div id=\"_r_5_\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><p class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-all text-[11px] text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"text-zinc-500\">url:</span> https://example.com</p></div></div><p data-testid=\"approval-waiting\" class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-tone-warn\">Waiting for you.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">The turn is paused until you answer. “Allow once” runs only this call; Deny refuses it and the assistant is told you declined.</p><p data-testid=\"approval-local-only\" class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">This chat is local only, so this asks every time.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" data-dock-primary=\"\" class=\"btn-accent text-xs\">Allow once</button><button type=\"button\" data-dock-decline=\"\" class=\"btn-ghost text