  "plan": "<div role=\"alertdialog\" aria-label=\"Approve approve_plan?\" class=\"space-y-2.5 rounded-xl border border-tone-warn/30 bg-tone-warn/[0.06] p-3\" data-testid=\"chat-approval-card\" data-count=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-question-mark shrink-0 text-tone-warn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.82 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-100\">The assistant wants to follow this plan <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">(<code class=\"rounded bg-ink-900/80 px-1 font-mono text-[12px]\" title=\"The exact tool that will run\">approve_plan</code>)</span>. Your call.</p></div><div data-testid=\"approval-preview\" data-preview=\"plan\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div id=\"_r_6_\" class=\"space-y-1.5\"><div data-testid=\"approval-plan\" data-list=\"plan\" class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-[11px] text-zinc-400\"><span class=\"text-zinc-500\">plan:</span> 2 steps</p><ol id=\"_r_7_\" aria-label=\"The plan, 2 steps\" class=\"list-decimal space-y-0.5 pl-6 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-300 marker:text-zinc-500\"><li data-testid=\"approval-plan-step\" class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words pl-1\">Read</li><li data-testid=\"approval-plan-step\" class=\"whitespace-pre-wrap break-words pl-1\">Write</li></ol></div></div></div><p data-testid=\"approval-waiting\" class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-tone-warn\">Waiting for you.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">No step runs until you answer. “Allow once” lets it follow this plan; Deny ends the run before any