  "build_plan": "<div role=\"alertdialog\" aria-label=\"Approve exit_plan_mode?\" class=\"space-y-2.5 px-4 pb-4 pt-3\" data-testid=\"chat-approval-card\" data-count=\"1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-question-mark shrink-0 text-tone-warn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M9.1 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.82 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-zinc-100\">The assistant wants to start working on this plan <span class=\"text-zinc-400\">(<code class=\"rounded bg-ink-900/80 px-1 font-mono text-[12px]\" title=\"The exact tool that will run\">exit_plan_mode</code>)</span>. Your call.</p></div><div data-testid=\"approval-plan-text\" class=\"max-h-48 overflow-y-auto rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] px-3 py-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-200\"><ol class=\"my-1.5 list-decimal space-y-1 pl-5\">\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;>p]:my-0\">Read the file</li>\n<li class=\"leading-relaxed [&amp;>p]:my-0\">Fix it</li>\n</ol></div><p data-testid=\"approval-waiting\" class=\"text-[11px] font-medium text-tone-warn\">Waiting for you.</p><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-zinc-400\">Nothing changes until you answer. “Allow and run” approves this plan and Iron Jarvis starts carrying it out at once, with no message from you; Deny keeps it planning.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\"><button type=\"button\" data-dock-primary=\"\" class=\"btn-accent text-xs\">Allow and run</button><button type=\"button\" data-dock-decline=\"\" class=\"btn-ghost text-xs text-tone-danger\">Deny</button></div></div>",
